ull, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "lands.png", "id": "2148736982627005", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618064_2148736985960338_7090380788208660940_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QsmUqSuRQT8Q7kNvwGlJ-54&_nc_oc=Adp4ddL39SuG-aoPtiOhdq67n-6HSvqMA5XIG5TQPKd7DSWyXZCrPk4cQt8eRjpipk8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQChflTVav1MsQlMUtOBqn7Hq2MWpnypLLw6n1v2hO0dg&oe=6AFC64DB"}, "display_name": "I am a carpenter", "keywords": ["VRSimulation", "carpentrysimulator", "woodworkingVR", "vrworkshop", "VRbuildinggame"], "long_description": "\ud83d\udd28 Become a Carpenter\u2026 or Not\n\nStep into a fully interactive VR workshop where every tool feels real and every action matters.\n\nSaw wood, hammer nails, and assemble pieces with true-to-life physics.\nEvery movement is in your hands.\n\n\ud83e\udeb5 Satisfying Crafting Mechanics\n\nFeel the difference:\n\nPull the saw back and forth\nHit nails with precision\nSnap pieces perfectly into place\n\nBuilt for maximum immersion and satisfying gameplay.\n\n\ud83d\ude02 Or Just Break Everything\n\nNot in the mood to build?\n\nGo wild:\n\nThrow objects\nSmash furniture\nCreate chaos\n\nThis is not just a simulator\u2026 it\u2019s a sandbox.\n\n\ud83e\udde9 Challenge Yourself\nMultiple levels with increasing difficulty\nFrom simple tasks to complex builds\nTest your precision and creativity\n\nCan you master every project?\n\n\ud83c\udfae Designed for VR\nRealistic hand interaction\nPhysics-driven gameplay\nSmooth and responsive controls\n\nMade for Meta Quest players who love immersive experiences\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Why You\u2019ll Love It\nSatisfying gameplay loop\nEasy to start, hard to master\nPerfect mix of simulation + fun + chaos\n\ud83c\udfaf Final CTA\n\nStep into the workshop.", "short_description": "A physics-based VR carpentry simulator where precision meets chaos."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privac